<article class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
  <h1>About</h1>

  <p>I'm Bryan Beshore, Co-founder & CTO of <a href="https://topkey.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Topkey</a>, where we're building financial infrastructure for property managers.</p>

  <p>Previously, I founded <a href="https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/keychain-logistics" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Keychain Logistics</a> (YC S12), a marketplace connecting shippers with truck drivers.</p>

  <p>I also bootstrapped <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20180115000000*/instantammo.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instant Ammo</a> to hundreds of thousands of dollars in revenue. I built it to learn Python, scripting, and Shopify's API while leveraging my shipping expertise from Keychain. It was meant to be a learning project, but it made real money. When other priorities emerged, I shut it down rather than run something I wasn't fully committed to.</p>

  <p>I've been building software and startups for over 15 years. I write about engineering, startups, and the intersection of technology and business.</p>

  <h2>Investing</h2>
  <p>I'm a Venture Partner at <a href="https://pioneerfund.vc" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Pioneer Fund</a> and have personally invested in 10+ startups as an angel investor.</p>

